WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.901
-Hello, everyone,

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:03.235
and welcome back to the
captain's quarters.

00:00:03.235 --> 00:00:05.304
As we mentioned, my parents
visited this past week,

00:00:05.304 --> 00:00:07.640
and on Tuesday,
we showed you my father

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:10.309
giving his tough-love feedback
to the sea captain,

00:00:10.309 --> 00:00:12.879
but my mom also chimed in.

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:15.848
So we're gonna show you
her far gentler response

00:00:15.848 --> 00:00:17.383
at the end of tonight's show.

00:00:17.383 --> 00:00:19.786
I should also note that
next week will be

00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:23.089
our final shows in this
location, which is sad.

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:25.992
It's really sad, because
that barely gives us time

00:00:25.992 --> 00:00:27.894
to introduce popular
new characters

00:00:27.894 --> 00:00:30.830
like the fish
who probably has a drug problem.

00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:35.601
-Hi, guys.
Can I borrow 50 bucks?

00:00:35.601 --> 00:00:37.504
-What's it for, Steve?

00:00:37.504 --> 00:00:39.005
-What do you need it for, Steve?

00:00:39.005 --> 00:00:41.307
-I need it for bus fare,
my mom hurt her knee,

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:43.276
and investment opportunities.

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:44.843
-Oh, Steve.

00:00:44.843 --> 00:00:46.546
-You need help, Steve.

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:49.015
-Isn't it a shame
we don't have time for that?

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:51.985
Anyway, Senator Kamala Harris
made her first public appearance

00:00:51.985 --> 00:00:53.520
as Joe Biden's
running mate yesterday

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:55.454
while President Trump
and his allies

00:00:55.454 --> 00:00:57.256
strained to come up
with increasingly

00:00:57.256 --> 00:00:58.891
ridiculous ways to attack her.

00:00:58.891 --> 00:01:01.360
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:05.231
♪♪

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:07.133
Yesterday, Biden and Harris
made their first

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:09.836
campaign appearance together,
and it was a historic moment,

00:01:09.836 --> 00:01:12.071
with Harris becoming
the first black woman

00:01:12.071 --> 00:01:15.408
and the first Asian-American to
appear on a major party ticket,

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:17.409
which sets up quite a contrast

00:01:17.409 --> 00:01:19.112
with the
Republican Vice President,

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:24.650
whose 23andMe DNA profile
came back 92% Irish ghost.

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:27.587
The other 8% was English ghost.

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:29.856
Harris had her first chance
to go after Trump

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:32.391
as the Democratic candidate
for Vice President,

00:01:32.391 --> 00:01:33.993
and she took aim squarely

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:36.396
at his response
to the coronavirus pandemic.

00:01:36.396 --> 00:01:39.265
-When other countries
are following the science,

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:43.369
Trump pushed miracle cures
he saw on Fox News.

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:45.704
-"It's not a miracle.
It works.

00:01:45.704 --> 00:01:48.874
If you chug a full bottle
of Pepto Bismol,

00:01:48.874 --> 00:01:50.176
stick a hairdryer up your butt,

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:51.643
and flush a double-A battery
down the toilet,

00:01:51.643 --> 00:01:52.878
you can cure coronavirus.

00:01:52.878 --> 00:01:55.114
If you don't believe me,
just ask this Fauci puppet

00:01:55.114 --> 00:01:57.016
my staff made me
because the real Fauci

00:01:57.016 --> 00:01:58.417
puts me in a bad mood."

00:01:58.417 --> 00:02:00.052
-Side note here --
in case there are any

00:02:00.052 --> 00:02:01.955
conservatives who hate-watch
"A Closer Look,"

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:03.689
I should say, for safety's sake,

00:02:03.689 --> 00:02:05.424
that double-A battery cure
doesn't really work.

00:02:05.424 --> 00:02:06.992
You have to use a 9-volt.

00:02:06.992 --> 00:02:10.062
Biden announced his pick
of Harris via text on Tuesday,

00:02:10.062 --> 00:02:12.398
and when he heard the news,
Mike Pence immediately

00:02:12.398 --> 00:02:14.834
tried to hide
by blending into the background.

00:02:14.834 --> 00:02:18.103
"She can't debate me
if she can't see me."

00:02:18.103 --> 00:02:21.540
At the V.P. debate in October,
Pence is gonna send a mannequin

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:24.243
and a recorder in his place,
Ferris Bueller-style,

00:02:24.243 --> 00:02:26.045
and hope no one notices.

00:02:26.045 --> 00:02:27.147
"Thank you, Senator Harris.

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:28.848
Mr. Vice President,
your rebuttal."

00:02:28.848 --> 00:02:30.316
[ Cassette tape button
clicking, snoring ]

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:32.385
"Okay. Well, it sounds like
he's asleep.

00:02:32.385 --> 00:02:34.486
Senator Harris, back to you."

00:02:34.486 --> 00:02:35.521
When the news was announced
on Tuesday,

00:02:35.521 --> 00:02:38.090
Pence tried
to put on a brave face

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:40.426
as opposed to his usual...
no face?

00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:43.295
Although I'm not sure bravado
is really a posture

00:02:43.295 --> 00:02:45.264
that works well for Mike Pence.

00:02:45.264 --> 00:02:46.599
-On the way here, I just heard

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:48.901
that Joe Biden
named his running mate.

00:02:48.901 --> 00:02:51.971
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.971 --> 00:02:53.906
California Senator Kamala Harris

00:02:53.906 --> 00:02:56.142
will be the Democratic candidate
for Vice President.

00:02:56.142 --> 00:02:57.676
-Four more years!

00:02:57.676 --> 00:03:00.146
-You all might like to know that
the vice-presidential debate

00:03:00.146 --> 00:03:04.050
is gonna be held on October 7th
in Utah.

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:13.592
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:13.592 --> 00:03:18.297
So my message to the Democratic
candidate for Vice President,

00:03:18.297 --> 00:03:20.065
congratulations.

00:03:20.065 --> 00:03:21.968
I'll see you in Salt Lake City.

00:03:21.968 --> 00:03:24.303
-Is there anyone in the world

00:03:24.303 --> 00:03:26.706
with less swagger
than Mike Pence?

00:03:26.706 --> 00:03:28.274
Watching him try to act cocky

00:03:28.274 --> 00:03:31.411
is like watching an Amish
grandpa dance at a wedding.

00:03:32.812 --> 00:03:34.947
"Hey, macarena."

00:03:34.947 --> 00:03:37.450
And, look, I know Pence
didn't pick the debate location,

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:40.719
but is there a whiter throwdown
in history

00:03:40.719 --> 00:03:42.989
than "See you
in Salt Lake City"?

00:03:42.989 --> 00:03:44.957
That's like hearing someone say,
"Why don't we settle

00:03:44.957 --> 00:03:46.425
our differences at
the Williams-Sonoma

00:03:46.425 --> 00:03:48.127
Instant Pot aisle,
8:00 a.m. sharp,

00:03:48.127 --> 00:03:49.929
'cause I got pilates at 9:00."

00:03:49.929 --> 00:03:52.164
They really have no idea
how to attack Harris.

00:03:52.164 --> 00:03:53.600
They're flailing.

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:56.135
First, they criticized the way
Biden made the announcement.

00:03:56.135 --> 00:03:58.571
White House press secretary
Kayleigh McEnany tweeted...

00:04:07.746 --> 00:04:08.781
Good point, Kayleigh.

00:04:08.781 --> 00:04:10.649
The Internet
is just a passing fad.

00:04:10.649 --> 00:04:12.919
The future is all about
network television.

00:04:12.919 --> 00:04:15.721
Also, did you forget
that the guy you work for

00:04:15.721 --> 00:04:17.957
uses Twitter so much
he had his phone

00:04:17.957 --> 00:04:20.092
surgically attached to his face?

00:04:20.092 --> 00:04:23.629
Not only did Trump announce his
V.P. pick on Twitter in 2016,

00:04:23.629 --> 00:04:26.632
the dude even fires people on
Twitter because he's too scared

00:04:26.632 --> 00:04:27.967
to talk to them face to face.

00:04:27.967 --> 00:04:30.169
If Trump ever dumps Pence
from the ticket,

00:04:30.169 --> 00:04:31.904
we're gonna find out
from a tweet that says,

00:04:31.904 --> 00:04:33.906
"Can someone ask Mike
to bring me a Diet Coke

00:04:33.906 --> 00:04:36.342
before security escorts him
from the building?"

00:04:36.342 --> 00:04:39.011
Also, this basement
talking point is so dumb.

00:04:39.011 --> 00:04:41.347
Say what you want about the guy,
but he's out in public

00:04:41.347 --> 00:04:44.483
all the time making speeches,
riding bikes,

00:04:44.483 --> 00:04:46.518
driving a Stingray
in his Aviators

00:04:46.518 --> 00:04:48.153
like a grandpa
who's on the prowl.

00:04:48.153 --> 00:04:49.455
"Grandpa, where are you going?"

00:04:49.455 --> 00:04:51.256
"I'm going down to bingo night
to meet some ladies.

00:04:51.256 --> 00:04:52.391
Don't wait up."

00:04:52.391 --> 00:04:54.326
"Grandpa, it's 3:00
in the afternoon."

00:04:54.326 --> 00:04:56.462
Trump is the one who spends
all his time

00:04:56.462 --> 00:04:57.930
haunting his own golf course

00:04:57.930 --> 00:05:00.633
like the legend
of Haggard Vance.

00:05:00.633 --> 00:05:04.137
-Eh. It's a slant rhyme,
but I'll allow it.

00:05:04.137 --> 00:05:06.139
-Also, we're all
in our basements.

00:05:06.139 --> 00:05:07.507
It's a pandemic.

00:05:07.507 --> 00:05:09.776
I spent the first half
of the summer talking to

00:05:09.776 --> 00:05:10.977
the wasps in my attic
and the second half

00:05:10.977 --> 00:05:13.179
befriending a sea captain
painting, a wooden duck,

00:05:13.179 --> 00:05:15.213
and a fish who keeps
asking me for Sudafed.

00:05:15.213 --> 00:05:17.116
-Well, I have a cold!

00:05:17.116 --> 00:05:19.151
-You don't have a cold, Steve!

00:05:19.151 --> 00:05:20.286
-You need help, Steve.

00:05:20.286 --> 00:05:21.787
-And, again, everybody,
after tonight,

00:05:21.787 --> 00:05:23.689
only four more shows
with all these guys.

00:05:23.689 --> 00:05:25.224
But just because
we love your feedback,

00:05:25.224 --> 00:05:28.094 line:0%
we're posting a new poll
on twitter @SeaCaptainPolls,

00:05:28.094 --> 00:05:29.962 line:0%
where your options will be,
"I think the sea captain

00:05:29.962 --> 00:05:31.998
was a nice addition during
a difficult time,"

00:05:31.998 --> 00:05:33.999
or "I hate fun."

00:05:33.999 --> 00:05:36.035
But Trump and his allies on Fox
really think

00:05:36.035 --> 00:05:38.738
this dumb basement talking point
is a political winner.

00:05:38.738 --> 00:05:41.340
Here's Sean Hannity
straining to find something

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:45.378
he can criticize about the way
Biden announced Harris' pick.

00:05:45.378 --> 00:05:47.880
-And just today the Biden
campaign photographer --

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:49.782
look at this --
they released a picture

00:05:49.782 --> 00:05:52.718
showing Joe
talking to Kamala Harris.

00:05:52.718 --> 00:05:53.919
Look at what you see there.

00:05:53.919 --> 00:05:56.222
There appears to be a script
in the picture,

00:05:56.222 --> 00:05:58.757
and Joe actually
has his phone backwards.

00:05:58.757 --> 00:06:02.060
-Oh, my goodness.
A script for a politician?

00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:03.862
What's next, a podium?

00:06:03.862 --> 00:06:06.198
"Look at what you see.
Joe Biden appears to be

00:06:06.198 --> 00:06:09.035
standing behind
some sort of tiny wooden house.

00:06:09.035 --> 00:06:10.903
And why does he have
his name on the sign?

00:06:10.903 --> 00:06:12.805
So he can remember it?"

00:06:12.805 --> 00:06:15.541
At least when Biden uses a
script, he can actually read it,

00:06:15.541 --> 00:06:17.343
unlike a good friend of yours.

00:06:17.343 --> 00:06:21.313
-When they gaze upon
yo-semites -- yo-seminite's

00:06:21.313 --> 00:06:23.482
towering sequoias...

00:06:23.482 --> 00:06:27.353
I want to also thank the
Mindianapolis police department.

00:06:27.353 --> 00:06:28.721
They have been so incredible.

00:06:28.721 --> 00:06:30.456
Mindianapolis.
Mindianapolis.

00:06:30.456 --> 00:06:31.657
Mindianapolis.

00:06:31.657 --> 00:06:35.327
They sacrifice every day
for the furniture --

00:06:35.327 --> 00:06:37.663
future of their children.

00:06:37.663 --> 00:06:41.867
Prevent Iran
from developing an Internet --

00:06:41.867 --> 00:06:45.237
This is so totally important --

00:06:45.237 --> 00:06:48.841
an intercontinental
ballistic missile.

00:06:48.841 --> 00:06:50.343
-I know Trump's a teetotaler,

00:06:50.343 --> 00:06:51.877
but whenever he's
reading off a script,

00:06:51.877 --> 00:06:54.546
he has the exact mannerisms
of a guy who's desperately

00:06:54.546 --> 00:06:56.482
trying to hide
that he's drunk at work.

00:06:56.482 --> 00:06:58.117
That's why he's always
swaying back and forth

00:06:58.117 --> 00:07:00.319
even when
he's trying to stand still.

00:07:00.319 --> 00:07:02.855
[ Slurring ] "As you can see
from this slide,

00:07:02.855 --> 00:07:05.758
quarterly prostitutes -- and
this is so totally important.

00:07:05.758 --> 00:07:09.061
But quarterly profits are...
at an all-time high.

00:07:09.061 --> 00:07:11.797
And on this next slide,
you can see that --

00:07:11.797 --> 00:07:13.232
I totally love you guys."

00:07:13.232 --> 00:07:14.400
And then there's Trump,

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:16.435
who tried maybe
the dumbest attack of all.

00:07:16.435 --> 00:07:18.905
The only thing he could come up
with was complaining

00:07:18.905 --> 00:07:21.473
that she was too mean
to Brett Kavanaugh.

00:07:21.473 --> 00:07:25.278
-And now you have
sort of a madwoman, I call her,

00:07:25.278 --> 00:07:28.981
because she was so angry
and such hatred

00:07:28.981 --> 00:07:30.415
with Justice Kavanaugh.

00:07:30.415 --> 00:07:32.151
I mean, I've never
seen anything like it.

00:07:32.151 --> 00:07:34.520
She was the angriest of the
group, and they were all angry.

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:37.990
-She was extraordinarily nasty
to Kavanaugh,

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:40.992
Judge Kavanaugh then,
now Justice Kavanaugh.

00:07:40.992 --> 00:07:45.798
She was nasty to a level
that was just a horrible thing.

00:07:45.798 --> 00:07:52.538
I thought she was the meanest,
the most horrible,

00:07:52.538 --> 00:07:56.241
most disrespectful
of anybody in the U.S. Senate.

00:07:56.241 --> 00:07:58.844
-These guys love
to joke about liberal tears,

00:07:58.844 --> 00:08:01.547
but they are the whiniest
little babies in the world.

00:08:01.547 --> 00:08:03.382
Trump sounds like he's sniffling
to his mom

00:08:03.382 --> 00:08:05.117
after getting home
from the playground.

00:08:05.117 --> 00:08:06.819
"She was the meanest,
most horrible,

00:08:06.819 --> 00:08:09.121
most disrespectful bully.
She gave me a wedgie."

00:08:09.121 --> 00:08:11.557
Also, you really think
that's a winner?

00:08:11.557 --> 00:08:14.894
She was mean to John Hughes
villain Brett Kavanaugh,

00:08:14.894 --> 00:08:17.163
the guy who looks like
he's in a "Where are they now?"

00:08:17.163 --> 00:08:19.531
about the preppy bad kid
from "Goonies"?

00:08:19.531 --> 00:08:21.500
"My father will turn
this entire neighborhood

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:22.835
into a country club."

00:08:22.835 --> 00:08:24.736
Hey, Speaking of villains
from John Hughes movies,

00:08:24.736 --> 00:08:27.440
I now have only one week left
to achieve my summer goal

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:29.675
of Steph
from "Pretty in Pink" hair.

00:08:29.675 --> 00:08:32.311
It's gonna be close,
but I really hope I can do it.

00:08:32.311 --> 00:08:34.280
-I believe in you.
-You can do it.

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:36.415
-I'm high all the time.

00:08:36.415 --> 00:08:38.517
-Trump and his allies
are flailing as they come up

00:08:38.517 --> 00:08:40.552
with increasingly absurd attacks
on Harris.

00:08:40.552 --> 00:08:42.822
All they have so far are their
usual dumb insults.

00:08:42.822 --> 00:08:44.657
You know,
attacks that are just...

00:08:44.657 --> 00:08:50.062
-Meanest, the most horrible,
most disrespectful.

00:08:50.062 --> 00:08:58.069
-This has been
"A Closer Look."

00:08:58.069 --> 00:08:59.738
-I like you, Sea Captain.

00:08:59.738 --> 00:09:04.409
-More than you like the duck?

00:09:04.409 --> 00:09:05.878
-Yeah, that means no.

00:09:05.878 --> 00:09:07.280
-Sorry, Sea Captain.

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:08.781
-Hillary!

00:09:08.781 --> 00:09:12.485
♪♪

00:09:12.485 --> 00:09:14.620 line:0%
-Now more than ever,
City Harvest needs your help

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:17.255 line:0%
feeding New York families
hit by the COVID crisis.

00:09:17.255 --> 00:09:20.025 line:0%
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the donate button.

00:09:20.025 --> 00:09:24.363 line:0%
Stay safe, wash your hands,
wear a mask, we love you.

